---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const doors = [
  { name: 'Remove background', href: '/remove-background/', note: 'The tool itself. Pick a photo, the page cuts out the subject at full size, in your browser.' },
  { name: 'Batch remove background', href: '/batch-remove-background/', note: 'The same bench on a whole folder: one model download for the batch, every photo cut out at full size, one ZIP of transparent PNGs out.' },
  { name: 'Free background remover, full resolution', href: '/remove-background-full-resolution/', note: 'The same bench, with the full-size promise in plain words: the size you upload is the size you download.' },
  { name: 'Benchzy vs remove.bg', href: '/vs-remove-bg/', note: 'A facts-only comparison, dated and sourced: free sizes, credits, accounts, commercial use, and what happens on 1 December 2026.' },
  { name: 'remove.bg alternatives', href: '/remove-bg-alternatives/', note: 'The honest guide to the choices after the shutdown, including the official one inside Canva, with each wall marked from its own terms.' },
  { name: 'What happens to remove.bg on 1 December', href: '/remove-bg-december-1/', note: 'What closes, what happens to unused credits, where the API goes, and what to do before the date.' },
  { name: 'For remove.bg API users', href: '/remove-bg-api/', note: 'A short factual note: where the API is going, and the plain fact that Benchzy offers no API.' },
];
---

<Base title="Background removal, free and full size · Benchzy" description="The background-removal workshop: a free full-size remover that runs in your browser, an honest comparison with remove.bg, alternatives, and the 1 December shutdown explainer.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4">
    <section class="mt-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-deep">Workshop · background removal</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-black mt-2">Background removal</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        One job, done properly: the subject cut out at full size, free, with the work done inside
        your browser so your photo is never uploaded. The first run downloads the removal program
        (44.3 MB, printed before it loads). Around the tool sit the dated facts about the famous
        name in this job, which closes its standalone site on 1 December 2026.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-6 grid gap-4">
      {doors.map((d) => (
        <article class="ticket-soft p-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3">
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">{d.name}</h2>
          <p class="w-full text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">{d.note}</p>
          <a class="btn-primary no-underline mt-1" href={d.href}>Open</a>
        </article>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold border-b-2 border-ink pb-2">The same bench, in Spanish and Portuguese</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft max-w-2xl">
        The tool and its full-size promise also run in the languages remove.bg's readers are
        searching in. The strings were drafted in-house and are marked in the project notes as
        pending review by a native reader before any public launch.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4">
        <article class="ticket-soft p-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Quitar fondo de imagen gratis</h3>
          <p class="w-full text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">La herramienta en español, a tamaño completo, sin subir la foto.</p>
          <a class="btn-primary no-underline mt-1" href="/es/quitar-fondo-de-imagen-gratis/">Abrir</a>
          <a class="btn-primary no-underline mt-1" href="/es/quitar-fondo-resolucion-completa/">A resolución completa</a>
        </article>
        <article class="ticket-soft p-5 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-3">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold">Remover fundo de imagem grátis</h3>
          <p class="w-full text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">A ferramenta em português, em tamanho real, sem enviar a foto, e a página de alternativa grátis ao remove.bg.</p>
          <a class="btn-primary no-underline mt-1" href="/pt-br/remover-fundo-de-imagem-gratis/">Abrir</a>
          <a class="btn-primary no-underline mt-1" href="/pt-br/alternativa-gratis-ao-remove-bg/">Alternativa ao remove.bg</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 mb-4">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold border-b-2 border-ink pb-2">How the cutout is made</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          An open-weights program (ISNet, listed on the
          <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/credits/">credits page</a>) runs in this
          page through your browser's own machinery. It works out which pixels belong to the
          subject and writes a new picture where the rest is transparent. It arrives as 11 pieces
          your browser checks one by one before anything runs.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold border-b-2 border-ink pb-2">What we do not claim</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          We do not claim the best cutouts or the fastest ones. We have not run a head-to-head
          quality test against remove.bg on real photos, and our phone speed is unmeasured, so
          neither appears as a promise anywhere on this site. What is claimed is checkable: full
          size, free, no account, no counter, and a photo that never leaves your device, which
          you can <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/check-it-yourself/">check yourself</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
